cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "ladder-redshifts: redshifts from molecular line ladders as missing-fundamental pitch estimation"
abstract: >-
  A likelihood engine for spectroscopic redshifts of dusty galaxies from their CO and [CI] line ladders, treating
  the problem as missing-fundamental pitch estimation. It weights every predicted line by its expected S/N, counts
  predicted-but-absent lines against a hypothesis, and reports a confidence score with each answer. Exploratory
  work, tested on 18 real ALMA Band 3 scans (project 2016.1.00672.S), the ALMA Band 2 science-verification
  spectrum of SPT0027-50, and synthetic surveys.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Samuel
    family-names: Mindlin
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-12
license: MIT
keywords:
  - redshift
  - ALMA
  - CO line ladder
  - submillimetre galaxies
  - pitch estimation
  - spectral line identification
